&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baton.io/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Baton&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ryder.com/en-us/about-us&quot;&gt;Ryder&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;’s in-house product development group focused on harnessing emerging technologies to redefine transportation and logistics. With $10B in freight under management, our technology reaches every part of the U.S. economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We design and ship category-defining software that enables Ryder and its 50,000+ customers—including some of the world’s most well-known brands—to plan and execute freight intelligently, efficiently, and cost-effectively. Our work includes everything from customer-facing software to the data platform that will power the next era of innovation at Ryder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Baton’s mission&lt;/strong&gt;: enable supply chain on autopilot.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ryder acquired Baton in 2022 to power its next wave of digital products. We operate at startup speed, with Fortune 500 reach. If you have a passion for solving complex problems and creating impact for the engine of the American economy, you’ll love it here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Senior Product Manager, Machine Learning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hayes Valley, San Francisco, CA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Type: &lt;/strong&gt;Full Time&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Model:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote Days:&lt;/strong&gt; Monday &amp;amp; Friday&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office Days:&lt;/strong&gt; Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a visionary Senior Product Manager to own the product strategy for Baton&#39;s Machine Learning pod. Baton&#39;s ML infrastructure and model portfolio are maturing fast — from planning and scheduling optimization models to ETA prediction to Generative AI models — and this role exists to make sure that investment converts into measurable, durable value for Ryder and its customers. This role is crucial as we expand our long-term roadmap to build the next-generation freight technology platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an early product manager at Baton, you’ll have an opportunity to make a huge impact through owning numerous mission-critical product initiatives. You&#39;ll own the 0-&amp;gt;1 definition and prioritization of AI-driven product initiatives, partner closely with ML/infrastructure engineers and data scientists, and drive the transition of pilots and PoCs into production. We&#39;re looking for someone scrappy, technically fluent, and driven to turn ML capability into shipped products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full product development life cycle, from need-finding to product vision and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product strategy and roadmap prioritization for the ML Pod&#39;s portfolio of models and AI initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the initiative to improve ETA prediction accuracy and other model metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address technological constraints that limit the growth of the business unit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop proposals and research different strategies to define our short-term roadmap and long-term vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with design to drive prototyping and early ideation of new product features and capabilities across various logistics workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with ML/infrastructure engineers and data scientists to prioritize the backlog against business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the go-to-market and adoption plan for AI capabilities across Ryder&#39;s freight and customer-facing platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate relationships to execute cross-department projects touching every inch of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep a mind toward future AI/ML product opportunities to help shape Baton&#39;s technical and product vision for 1, 5, and 10 years down the line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning product strategy and roadmap for a technically complex or ML/AI-driven product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building 0→1 products and delivering exceptional user experiences or business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of shipping traditional ML or Generative AI products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking an initiative through its full lifecycle: from PoC to production and monitoring/maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sufficient fluency in ML/AI concepts to prioritize effectively and earn engineering trust (not a hands-on/technical PM requirement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can quickly grasp whether or not AI is needed to solve the problem, and if so, can quickly determine what type of AI could solve it (prescriptive = mathematical optimization vs. predictive = traditional ML vs. generative AI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cross-functional and technical stakeholders across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to execute with minimal guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data-driven analytical skills to back up assumptions and recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years experience in product management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in ambiguous situations, dynamic environments, and an understanding what fast-growing startups entail for PMs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a B2B SaaS environment, ideally within freight, logistics, manufacturing, or another operationally complex industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with MLOps or ML infrastructure teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Base Salary + Cash Bonus Structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Company Bonus + Long-Term Incentive Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k with Matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Work Schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hyper-Stable, publicly traded Enterprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, and Vision Health Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Program (15% discount to market value)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, Fun, and Tech-Forward office in Hayes Valley, San Francisco, CA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Range:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The annual base salary range for this position is $190,000 - $240,000*. Compensation will vary based on factors including skill level, proficiencies, transferable knowledge, and experience. In addition to base salary, Baton&#39;s full-time employees are eligible for an annual performance bonus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You Should Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have an immediate impact:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With Ryder’s existing customer base of 50,000+ companies and an internal headcount of 43,000, the scale and impact of our products will be large and far-reaching, from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity to grow and lead in a Fortune 500 company:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll get to work in a rapidly growing, startup-like environment while having the stability and backing of Ryder and its full executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative, fast-paced environment to solve impactful problems in Supply Chain:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re going to design completely new tools for an industry that hasn’t been rethought in decades. And to do this, we need people who think differently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

