&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain a robust data streaming and messaging architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of our near real-time data streaming platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical liaison to ensure alignment of data strategies with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take charge of the entire data landscape, encompassing near real-time data ingestion, sophisticated processing, and efficient data consumption strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with data stakeholders to simplify and solve complex data challenges, transforming them into scalable and maintainable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Everything from developing and maintaining data pipelines, enhancing data models, to refining API layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Systems Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates experience with real-time data systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relational table modeling and Event driven pipeline architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working familiarity with SQL: Query Performance Analysis, Optimization, and Construction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python Proficiency&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency coding in python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s Degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of Software Engineering experience, with a preference for backgrounds in event-driven architecture or real-time data streaming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated interest or experience in the freight and logistics industry, with a keen understanding of its data-driven challenges and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in data analytics and big data technologies, with the ability to leverage these skills to drive insights and operational efficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Base Salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Company Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Long Term Cash Incentive Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k with Matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Work Schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Health Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hyper-Stable, publicly traded Enterprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Program (15% discount to market value)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, Tech-Forward, Cozy office environment in Hayes Valley&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Range:&lt;/strong&gt; The annual base salary range for this position is $162,000 - $216,000*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on factors including skill level, transferable knowledge, and experience.&lt;br&gt;Note that the above is not the representation of total compensation, which includes our LTI Package as well.&lt;br&gt;In addition to base salary, Baton&#39;s full-time employees are eligible for an annual company performance bonuses.&lt;/p&gt;
